      "event": "Global climate refugee crisis peaks.",
      "detail": "Over 500 million people are displaced by rising sea levels and extreme weather. International cooperation finally leads to massive resettlement programs and accelerated carbon removal efforts."
    },
    {
      "year": 2055,
      "event": "Human genetic enhancement becomes mainstream.",
