  "humanity_exists_in_10000": "uncertain",
  "summary": "Humanity will likely transform beyond recognition through merger with artificial intelligence and expansion across the galaxy, becoming something that transcends our current definition of human. While our descendants will exist, whether they can still be called 'humanity' in any meaningful sense remains uncertain."
